				"⣿⣿⠁⠀⠀",
				28,
				12
			],
			"Message": "feat(Project): Update submodules with critical enhancements across the Land ecosystem\n\nThis commit synchronizes all core Land elements to their latest versions, bringing significant improvements to the code editor's reliability, performance, and production readiness.\n\n- **Air**: Enhanced daemon lifecycle management with singleton enforcement and comprehensive health monitoring for core services (authentication, updates, downloader, indexing, gRPC), along with critical bug fixes in authentication decryption and dependency updates. This strengthens the background service infrastructure that supports the Vine gRPC communication layer.\n- **Cocoon**: Implemented an advanced SynchronizationService with real-time document synchronization, conflict resolution, and circuit breaker logic. Enhanced ConfigurationService with improved Tauri command integration and conflict handling, ensuring reliable state synchronization with the Mountain backend.\n- **Mountain**: Integrated the actual Air gRPC client from the Air element, replacing placeholder implementations and enabling real communication via the Vine protocol. Added robust state recovery mechanisms for poisoned locks, corrupted mementos, and failed extension scans, fulfilling Mountain's contract with Air as defined in Common.\n- **Wind**: Enhanced configuration service resiliency with graceful fallbacks and exponential backoff retry logic. Removed development mocks in favor of real Tauri API imports, marking a key milestone in Wind's transition to production-ready Effect-TS architecture.\n- **Other Elements**: Updated dependencies across Echo, Rest, and other build/maintenance components to ensure ecosystem consistency.\n\nThese collective enhancements reinforce Land's declarative effects-based architecture, improve cross-component communication reliability, and advance the project toward a stable production release.",
			"SHA": "50083a3631456ba68183928b2cac28d61f87f0e7"
		},
